  },
  {
    "id": "inspectOrbit",
    "type": "orbit",
    "teaches": "Rotating the focused 3D solid lets the learner see its circular cross-sections, the elliptical end caps, and (for the tube) the hollow interior from any viewpoint, confirming the rotational symmetry about the axis"
  }
]

DEMO STEPS (tween through these using goToStep(); each step drives the controls above):
[
  {
    "title": "(a) Rectangle → cylinder",
